// title: Something happens at a place
// about: Found while exploring: an opening, then take it or leave it.
// kind: event
// order: 2
// step: When
// question: name|Name|name||A name for you; players do not see it.
// question: area|While exploring which area?|zone||Exploring is the most common way to find an event. An area is where creatures roam and things are found.
// question: repeat|How often|choice:once,until resolved,always|once|Once, until it is finished, or every time.
// step: What happens
// question: opening|What does the player find?|prose|You discover something unexpected.
// question: item|An item to take (optional)|item?|
== event {{id}}
name: {{name}}
found by: exploring in {{area}}
repeat: {{repeat}}
outcomes: taken, left
play:
    {{opening}}
    * Take it
        {{item_effect}}
        ~ outcome taken
        ~ resolve
        -> end
    * Leave it
        ~ outcome left
        -> end
